&"0_3": {
"link": &"1_20",
"offset": Vector2(-240, 960),
"start_id": "ALIGNMENT"
},
&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "Its kind of hard to explain...",
"offset": Vector2(40, 60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "This is the longest dream I've ever had",
"offset": Vector2(2260, 340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_11",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246.00037),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "Though I'm sure that doesn't mean anything to you if you don't think I'm real...",
"offset": Vector2(2580, 340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_17",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246.00037),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "That's the spirit! Might as well enjoy the ride.",
"offset": Vector2(2340, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "That's rough buddy.",
"offset": Vector2(2040, -280),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 246),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_14": {
"dialogue": "I think you'll find its not so bad once you've been here a bit longer",
"offset": Vector2(3680, 80),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_15",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_15": {
"dialogue": "...",
"offset": Vector2(4000, 80),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_16",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 246),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_16": {
"dialogue": "And are able to roam a bit more freely, of course.",
"offset": Vector2(4320, 80),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "What's the rest of this place like?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Is it just this hotel?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 316),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_17": {
"dialogue": "I think you'll find this \"dream\" more real than you're likely used to.",
"offset": Vector2(2940, 340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_18",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246.00037),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_18": {
"dialogue": "But it shouldn't be too much of a nightmare, I hope.",
"offset": Vector2(3260, 340),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246.00037),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_19": {
"dialogue": "Part of the [el]Blue[/el]-aligned condition is our legs merging into a sort of trunk-like structure. Which, needless to say, makes travel difficult.",
"offset": Vector2(0, 1460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_30",
"text": "Oh wow"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_28",
"text": "So you're stuck in place?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 316.00012),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_2": {
"dialogue": "You know the backrooms?",
"offset": Vector2(360, 60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_4",
"text": "Yes"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_3",
"text": "No"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 316),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_20": {
"dialogue": "You remember the difference between your [i]primary[/i] and [i]secondary[/i] types, right?",
"offset": Vector2(-20, 960),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_21",
"text": "Yes"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_22",
"text": "No"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 316.00006),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_21": {
"dialogue": "So right now, you two are \"unaligned,\" which means your core can change.",
"offset": Vector2(800, 980),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_23",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_22": {
"dialogue": "Your [i]primary[/i] type is simply the composition of your core. Its whichever element forms the majority of your spine, heart, etc.",
"offset": Vector2(380, 1180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_21",
"text": "Gotcha"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 280.99985),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_23": {
"dialogue": "Not often, to be sure. Mostly when you level up.",
"offset": Vector2(1140, 1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_24",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_24": {
"dialogue": "However, given time, you'll develop an alignment. When this happens, your core will become \"locked\" to a specific element.",
"offset": Vector2(1460, 1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_25",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_25": {
"dialogue": "Myself, as well as those gentlemen over there, are [el]Blue[/el]-aligned.",
"offset": Vector2(1800, 1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_26",
"text": "So your primary type is forever Blue?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 281),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_26": {
"dialogue": "Precisely. And when this happens, it comes with certain mutations. For us [el]Blues[/el], this means tentacles and trunks. ",
"offset": Vector2(2120, 1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_27",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_27": {
"dialogue": "But for other colors, this can range from scales, to shells, to evaporating to mist.",
"offset": Vector2(2440, 1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_28": {
"dialogue": "A good question, but no.",
"offset": Vector2(342.33307, 1720.0094),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_29",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246.00006),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_29": {
"dialogue": "We have little feet we can wobble around on, but its slow and quite tiring.",
"offset": Vector2(680, 1720),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_30",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_3": {
"dialogue": "Oh, well then I got nothing",
"offset": Vector2(720, 460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_7",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 245.99994),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_30": {
"dialogue": "Because of this, we have a tendency to form small groups, which are called enclaves.",
"offset": Vector2(1080, 1500),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_31",
"text": "That must suck"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": "Does it hurt?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 316.00012),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_31": {
"dialogue": "I feared the same, many, many years ago. ",
"offset": Vector2(1480, 1460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_32",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246.00009),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_32": {
"dialogue": "But its not a fast process, so you have time to prepare yourself",
"offset": Vector2(1800, 1460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246.00009),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_33": {
"dialogue": "No, its not painful. Uncomfortable at times, sure, but not painful.",
"offset": Vector2(1480, 1720),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_34",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_34": {
"dialogue": "Its not a fast process, so you have time to prepare yourself",
"offset": Vector2(1800, 1720),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_4": {
"dialogue": "We've noclipped into the backrooms and we're here forever and have no escape and we'll never see anyone or anything from our previous life again...",
"offset": Vector2(680, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00037, 246),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_5": {
"dialogue": "It'll be okay, remember what we talked about.",
"offset": Vector2(1000, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_6",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 246),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_6": {
"dialogue": "Though I will say, you're being awfully calm about this.",
"offset": Vector2(1320, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_13",
"text": "I've already had my existential crisis today"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_12",
"text": "As long as I don't have to finish my calc homework"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_10",
"text": "This is just a weird dream..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 351),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_7": {
"dialogue": "You've been transported to another dimension.",
"offset": Vector2(1040, 500),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_9",
"text": "Huh, neat"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_8",
"text": "Is there anyway home?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00085, 315.99988),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_8": {
"dialogue": "Nope! We're here forever and have no escape and we'll never see anyone or anything from our previous life again...",
"offset": Vector2(1420, 700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 246.00015),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_9": {
"dialogue": "Neat?!? You're fine with that??",
"offset": Vector2(1620, 360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_13",
"text": "I've already had my existential crisis today"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_12",
"text": "As long as I don't have to finish my calc homework"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_10",
"text": "This is just a weird dream..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 351.00037),
"speaker": 1,
